// RA4 fixture: the combat terms of the RA3 fixture world (see that fixture for its warheads,
// weapons and types), with what the tests of RA4 need (ra4_*.rs; docs/RA2_PARITY_PLAN.md
// sections 4.3, 4.5 and 4.8). Fixture data, independent of the shipped balance (invariant I10).
//
// Weapons: the three launchers reach 12 cells and deal nothing themselves (the launcher's has
// a minimum range of 3 cells; the boat's is its secondary, used against what is underwater);
// the dart and the depth bomb are the one round of the drone and the hunter; the pod fires a
// volley of 2. Types: the rocket is unarmed (its impact is the effect v3_rocket, or
// v3_rocket_elite of an elite launcher); the drone's elite weapon is the heavy dart; the hunter
// attacks only what is underwater. The cannon of the tank becomes the autocannon at elite rank.
